  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ability to parry enemy spells is unmatched.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Parry Spell<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can expend a use of mythic power to attempt to counterspell an enemy’s spell as an immediate action. You may attempt a Spellcraft check to identify the spell you wish to counterspell prior to deciding to take this immediate action. You are staggered on your next turn after attempting the counterspell.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
